SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10
    Ba        5

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0             1
        -parms          1.0 1e-10
        -steps          10 in 100

RATES
Calcite
-start
10 sa = PARM(1)
20 k  = PARM(2)
30 rate = k*sa
40 if (rate > M) then rate = M
50 SAVE rate
-end
END
